{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1478026-stat-michael-morbius","id":1478026,"title":"Stat Michael Morbius","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-04T18:04:53-07:00","id":1478026,"title":"Stat Michael Morbius","content":"What would his sheet look like if we made the closest equivalent in VTM terms?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-04T21:37:46-07:00","id":1478031,"title":"","content":"Morbius is strange case. He is what is called a pseudo-vampire, aka living vampire, in the marvel comics.<ul><li>Thin-Blood, Ghoul, or a Dhampir. He doesn't have a weakness to sunlight or stakes in the comic, meaning one of these options will serve you best.</li> <li>He has access to Dominate, Auspex, Protean, Potence, Celerity, and Fortitude. He has shown use of almost ALL of these abilities and has at least 1 dot, except Protean with up to 2 dots, in each and every last one of them. If you're running this in V5, give him Thin-Blood Alchemy as it can use ALL of these abilities and then some. Like his ability to glide, which he also has.</li> <li>Morbius has serious mental issues, and his vampiric hunger often makes him see things that aren't there. This can best be represented with the Malkavian clan curse if in V5. Older editions can represent this well with derangements, most likely one that cause auditory and visual hallucinations.</li> <li>He is a genius! Prioritize Mental Attributes, most likely Intelligence. Social abilities are the least important Attributes for this character.</li> <li>Prioritize Knowledges, especially Medicine and Science, but don't prioritize combat abilities like melee or firearms. Morbius is not a formally trained fighter, he relies on his supernatural strength to fight.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><div align=\"left\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/7.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26764-vilenecromancer","name":"Vilenecromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26764_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"247"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-05T09:20:59-07:00","id":1478061,"title":"","content":"Movie version almost works as a straight up Gangrel. Protean, Animalism, and the physical disciplines. His flight would need to be homebrewed, though. Maybe a Potence 5 power that has soaring leap as a prerequisite that allows for true flight? Or a Protean power with Feather as a prereq that allows for flight without shapeshifting?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-12T04:15:52-07:00","id":1489869,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1478026-stat-michael-morbius?p=1478061#post1478061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Movie version almost works as a straight up Gangrel. Protean, Animalism, and the physical disciplines. His flight would need to be homebrewed, though. Maybe a Potence 5 power that has soaring leap as a prerequisite that allows for true flight? Or a Protean power with Feather as a prereq that allows for flight without shapeshifting?</div> </div> </div> </div>Can't you use Movement of the Mind on yourself to fly?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2078-alucard","name":"Alucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2078_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"811"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-12T06:26:37-07:00","id":1489883,"title":"","content":"Charisma 1 on account of being Jared Leto","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27252-hades","name":"Hades","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-12T09:34:17-07:00","id":1489893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1478026-stat-michael-morbius?p=1489883#post1489883\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Charisma 1 on account of being Jared Leto</div> </div> </div> </div>As much as I hate his Joker, I strongly disagree.<br /> <br /> The guy is a good enough actor and really good performer, with some stellar points, as seen in other works. And he's charismatic enough to have his own frigging messianic cult irl. That's certainly something to hold against him, but not against his charisma.<br /> <br /> Good actors do not solve bad direction, script and/or production choices. He was a poor choice for the role and pretty much directed to be that catastrophic failure, no amount of personal ability as an actor would solve that. I still think that was on purpose from the production perspective (the movie got a lot of attention from the backlash against Leto's Joker, with the character taking center and front on marketing, while he was never meant to really be an important part of the movie, it was fucking <i>Suicide Squad</i>, no major villain has any reason to be there).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1478026-stat-michael-morbius?p=1478061#post1478061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Movie version almost works as a straight up Gangrel. Protean, Animalism, and the physical disciplines. His flight would need to be homebrewed, though. Maybe a Potence 5 power that has soaring leap as a prerequisite that allows for true flight? Or a Protean power with Feather as a prereq that allows for flight without shapeshifting?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the best option would be to straight up adapt the Gargoyle Discipline of <b>Flight</b>. All things considered, I'd make it a <b>Protean</b> power in V5.<br /> <br /> But for Comics Morbius I would stick to previous editions just because I think he actually works best by Mage rules. While he seems like a vampire, he's actually man-bat Thaumivore dealing with the side effects of too many magical effects fundamentally altering his Pattern. That doesn't mean he couldn't be meant primarily for use within a Vampire game, just that the Mage path would be the best to cover him both mechanically and conceptually.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-12T09:56:02-07:00","id":1489896,"title":"","content":"I see so many Morbius memes I'm starting to feel like I need to see it. Please tell me not to go.<br /> And yeah, IRL Jared Leto uses the fact that he's famous and looks like White Jesus to slip his slightly-over-50 self into very-much-under-20 fans. The man is an extreme creep, but his social attributes are going to be high.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-12T11:01:33-07:00","id":1489904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1478026-stat-michael-morbius?p=1489896#post1489896\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see so many Morbius memes I'm starting to feel like I need to see it. Please tell me not to go.<br /> And yeah, IRL Jared Leto uses the fact that he's famous and looks like White Jesus to slip his slightly-over-50 self into very-much-under-20 fans. The man is an extreme creep, but his social attributes are going to be high.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't go. You have better things to do with your time, money, and the flimsy hope of Sony that one day they'll recoup their money.<br /> <br /> Why is Sony <b>still</b> fighting to keep their license, anyway?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}